cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Saluca Detection Content"
message: "If you use this detection content, please cite it."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Ruvalcaba
    given-names: Cristian
    affiliation: "Saluca LLC"
  - name: "Saluca Agentic AI Research Team"
repository-code: "https://github.com/saluca-labs/detection-content"
license: Apache-2.0
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: 2026-08-20
abstract: >-
  Detection engineering content for public threat campaigns, published one pack per
  campaign under a single growing citation. Each pack states what it cannot detect before
  what it can, and marks every rule as either an alert or a hunting rule. Rules ship as
  experimental until tuned against real telemetry.
keywords:
  - detection engineering
  - threat detection
  - sigma
  - yara
  - suricata
  - agentic ai security
references:
  - type: software
    title: "Borrowed Trust: Detection Content for Three Concurrent Signed-Binary Sideload Campaigns"
    doi: "10.5281/zenodo.21880002"
    notes: "Published separately before consolidation into this repository. Cited, not replaced."
